# Doom Reigns Supreme triggers for "a Villain you control" entering: Bot1's Ornithopter is no Villain and Bot2's Aerial
# Doombot is not Bot1's, so neither drains or adds a plan counter; Bot1's Serpent Specialist does (Bot2 to 19, Bot1 to 21,
# one plan counter).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Doom Reigns Supreme
Ornithopter
Mox Emerald
Serpent Specialist
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Aerial Doombot
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Doom Reigns Supreme.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Doom Reigns Supreme.Counters.Plan = (absent)
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Aerial Doombot.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Doom Reigns Supreme.Counters.Plan = (absent)
? Bot2.Life = 20
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Serpent Specialist.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Doom Reigns Supreme.Counters.Plan = 1
Bot2.Life = 19
Bot1.Life = 21
